{"id":"0f552e6bc6d7f516","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/176_量词自由_Presburger_算术_QFPA.md","title":"176 量词自由 Presburger 算术 QFPA","display":"176_量词自由_Presburger_算术_QFPA","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"176.-量词自由-Presburger-算术-QFPA\">176. 量词自由 Presburger 算术 QFPA</h1>\n<h1 id=\"1.-变量、项与公式符号\">1. 变量、项与公式符号</h1>\n<p>整数变量集为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ZVar}=\\{z_0,z_1,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{ZVar}=\\{z_0,z_1,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>。线性项构造符为整数常元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span>、变量、加法、取负和整数标量乘法 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\cdot t\">\\(k\\cdot t\\)</span>。原子公式构造符为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"t=u,\\qquad t\\le u,\\qquad t\\equiv_m r\\quad(m\\ge2,\\ 0\\le r&lt;m).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[t=u,\\qquad t\\le u,\\qquad t\\equiv_m r\\quad(m\\ge2,\\ 0\\le r&lt;m).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>逻辑构造符为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot,\\land,\\lor,\\to\">\\(\\bot,\\land,\\lor,\\to\\)</span>。本系统不含量词构造符。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-量词自由语法\">2. 量词自由语法</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA}\">\\(\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA}\\)</span> 是满足下列条款的最小集合。</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span>，则整数常元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\\in\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA}\">\\(\\bar n\\in\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\in\\mathsf{ZVar}\">\\(z\\in\\mathsf{ZVar}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{zvar}(z)\\in\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA}\">\\(\\operatorname{zvar}(z)\\in\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s+t\\in\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA}\">\\(s+t\\in\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA}\">\\(t\\in\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"-t\\in\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA}\">\\(-t\\in\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA}\">\\(t\\in\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\cdot t\\in\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA}\">\\(k\\cdot t\\in\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>该定义没有变量项之间的乘法构造。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{QFPA}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{QFPA}\\)</span> 是满足下列条款的最小集合。</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s=t\">\\(s=t\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\le t\">\\(s\\le t\\)</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{QFPA}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{QFPA}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA}\">\\(t\\in\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\ge2\">\\(m\\ge2\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\le r&lt;m\">\\(0\\le r&lt;m\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\equiv_m r\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{QFPA}\">\\(t\\equiv_m r\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{QFPA}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{QFPA}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{QFPA}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{QFPA}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{QFPA}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\land B\">\\(A\\land B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\lor B\">\\(A\\lor B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\">\\(A\\to B\\)</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{QFPA}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{QFPA}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A:=A\\to\\bot\">\\(\\neg A:=A\\to\\bot\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\leftrightarrow B:=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A)\">\\(A\\leftrightarrow B:=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变量与代换\">3. 自由变量与代换</h1>\n<p>项自由变量函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV_T}:\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{ZVar})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FV_T}:\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{ZVar})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由下列全部子句定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV_T}(\\bar n)=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{FV_T}(\\operatorname{zvar}(z))=\\{z\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FV_T}(\\bar n)=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{FV_T}(\\operatorname{zvar}(z))=\\{z\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV_T}(s+t)=\\mathrm{FV_T}(s)\\cup\\mathrm{FV_T}(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FV_T}(s+t)=\\mathrm{FV_T}(s)\\cup\\mathrm{FV_T}(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV_T}(-t)=\\mathrm{FV_T}(t),\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{FV_T}(k\\cdot t)=\\mathrm{FV_T}(t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FV_T}(-t)=\\mathrm{FV_T}(t),\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{FV_T}(k\\cdot t)=\\mathrm{FV_T}(t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式自由变量函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{QFPA}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{ZVar})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FV}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{QFPA}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{ZVar})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由下列全部子句定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}(s=t)=\\mathrm{FV_T}(s)\\cup\\mathrm{FV_T}(t),\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{FV}(s\\le t)=\\mathrm{FV_T}(s)\\cup\\mathrm{FV_T}(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FV}(s=t)=\\mathrm{FV_T}(s)\\cup\\mathrm{FV_T}(t),\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{FV}(s\\le t)=\\mathrm{FV_T}(s)\\cup\\mathrm{FV_T}(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}(t\\equiv_m r)=\\mathrm{FV_T}(t),\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FV}(t\\equiv_m r)=\\mathrm{FV_T}(t),\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}(A\\circ B)=\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(B)\n\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FV}(A\\circ B)=\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(B)\n\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本语言没有绑定构造，故</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{QFPA}(A)=\\varnothing\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{QFPA}(A)=\\varnothing\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{QFPA}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{QFPA}\\)</span> 成立。</p>\n<p>定义项代换</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub_T}:\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA}\\times\\mathsf{ZVar}\\times\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA}\\to\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub_T}:\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA}\\times\\mathsf{ZVar}\\times\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA}\\to\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r[z:=t]\">\\(r[z:=t]\\)</span>。其全部构造子子句为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bar n[z:=t]=\\bar n,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bar n[z:=t]=\\bar n,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{zvar}(y)[z:=t]=\n\\begin{cases}\nt,&amp;y=z,\\\\\n\\operatorname{zvar}(y),&amp;y\\ne z,\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{zvar}(y)[z:=t]=\n\\begin{cases}\nt,&amp;y=z,\\\\\n\\operatorname{zvar}(y),&amp;y\\ne z,\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(s+u)[z:=t]=s[z:=t]+u[z:=t],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(s+u)[z:=t]=s[z:=t]+u[z:=t],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(-s)[z:=t]=-(s[z:=t]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(-s)[z:=t]=-(s[z:=t]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(k\\cdot s)[z:=t]=k\\cdot(s[z:=t]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(k\\cdot s)[z:=t]=k\\cdot(s[z:=t]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义公式代换</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub_F}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{QFPA}\\times\\mathsf{ZVar}\\times\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{QFPA},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub_F}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{QFPA}\\times\\mathsf{ZVar}\\times\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{QFPA},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[z:=t]\">\\(A[z:=t]\\)</span>。其全部构造子子句为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(s=u)[z:=t]=(s[z:=t]=u[z:=t]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(s=u)[z:=t]=(s[z:=t]=u[z:=t]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(s\\le u)[z:=t]=(s[z:=t]\\le u[z:=t]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(s\\le u)[z:=t]=(s[z:=t]\\le u[z:=t]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(s\\equiv_m r)[z:=t]=(s[z:=t]\\equiv_m r),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(s\\equiv_m r)[z:=t]=(s[z:=t]\\equiv_m r),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bot[z:=t]=\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bot[z:=t]=\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A\\land B)[z:=t]=A[z:=t]\\land B[z:=t],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A\\land B)[z:=t]=A[z:=t]\\land B[z:=t],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A\\lor B)[z:=t]=A[z:=t]\\lor B[z:=t],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A\\lor B)[z:=t]=A[z:=t]\\lor B[z:=t],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A\\to B)[z:=t]=A[z:=t]\\to B[z:=t].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A\\to B)[z:=t]=A[z:=t]\\to B[z:=t].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z,y\\in\\mathsf{ZVar}\">\\(z,y\\in\\mathsf{ZVar}\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FreeRen}_{QFPA}(A,z,y)=A[z:=\\operatorname{zvar}(y)],\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{QFPA}(A,z,y)=A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FreeRen}_{QFPA}(A,z,y)=A[z:=\\operatorname{zvar}(y)],\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{QFPA}(A,z,y)=A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>第二式是无绑定语言上的恒等操作。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_\\alpha^{QFPA}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_\\alpha^{QFPA}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>有限析取构造函数为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FinOr}_{QFPA}:\n\\{(F,m):m\\in\\mathbb N\\land F:m\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{QFPA}\\}\n\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{QFPA}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FinOr}_{QFPA}:\n\\{(F,m):m\\in\\mathbb N\\land F:m\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{QFPA}\\}\n\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{QFPA}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:m\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{QFPA}\">\\(F:m\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{QFPA}\\)</span>，则递归定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FinOr}_{QFPA}(F,0)=\\bot,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FinOr}_{QFPA}(F,m+1)=F(m)\\lor\\operatorname{FinOr}_{QFPA}(F{\\upharpoonright}m,m).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FinOr}_{QFPA}(F,0)=\\bot,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FinOr}_{QFPA}(F,m+1)=F(m)\\lor\\operatorname{FinOr}_{QFPA}(F{\\upharpoonright}m,m).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-命题公理与线性整数公理\">4. 命题公理与线性整数公理</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Bool}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Bool}}\\)</span> 定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Bool}}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{B1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{B2}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{B3},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Bool}}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{B1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{B2}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{B3},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{B1}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{QFPA}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{B1}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{QFPA}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{B2}=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):\nA,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{QFPA}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{B2}=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):\nA,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{QFPA}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{B3}=\n\\{((A\\to\\bot)\\to(B\\to\\bot))\\to(B\\to A):\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{QFPA}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{B3}=\n\\{((A\\to\\bot)\\to(B\\to\\bot))\\to(B\\to A):\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{QFPA}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>量词自由等号公理为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{=}\n=\\{t=t:t\\in\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{s=t\\to(C[z:=s]\\leftrightarrow C[z:=t]):\ns,t\\in\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA},\\ z\\in\\mathsf{ZVar},\\\nC\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{QFPA}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{=}\n=\\{t=t:t\\in\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{s=t\\to(C[z:=s]\\leftrightarrow C[z:=t]):\ns,t\\in\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA},\\ z\\in\\mathsf{ZVar},\\\nC\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{QFPA}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Group}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Group}}\\)</span> 定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{(s+t)+u=s+(t+u),\\ s+t=t+s,\\ s+\\bar0=s,\\ s+(-s)=\\bar0:\ns,t,u\\in\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{(s+t)+u=s+(t+u),\\ s+t=t+s,\\ s+\\bar0=s,\\ s+(-s)=\\bar0:\ns,t,u\\in\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\cup\n\\{k\\cdot(s+t)=k\\cdot s+k\\cdot t,\\ \n(k+\\ell)\\cdot s=k\\cdot s+\\ell\\cdot s,\\ \n1\\cdot s=s:\nk,\\ell\\in\\mathbb Z,\\ s,t\\in\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\cup\n\\{k\\cdot(s+t)=k\\cdot s+k\\cdot t,\\ \n(k+\\ell)\\cdot s=k\\cdot s+\\ell\\cdot s,\\ \n1\\cdot s=s:\nk,\\ell\\in\\mathbb Z,\\ s,t\\in\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>整数数码计算公理族定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Const}}=\n\\{\\bar m+\\bar n=\\overline{m+n},\\ -\\bar n=\\overline{-n},\\\nk\\cdot\\bar n=\\overline{kn}:m,n,k\\in\\mathbb Z\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Const}}=\n\\{\\bar m+\\bar n=\\overline{m+n},\\ -\\bar n=\\overline{-n},\\\nk\\cdot\\bar n=\\overline{kn}:m,n,k\\in\\mathbb Z\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\le}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\le}\\)</span> 定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{s\\le s,\\ (s\\le t\\land t\\le u)\\to s\\le u,\\\n(s\\le t\\land t\\le s)\\to s=t,\\ s\\le t\\lor t\\le s:\ns,t,u\\in\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{s\\le s,\\ (s\\le t\\land t\\le u)\\to s\\le u,\\\n(s\\le t\\land t\\le s)\\to s=t,\\ s\\le t\\lor t\\le s:\ns,t,u\\in\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\cup\n\\{s\\le t\\to s+u\\le t+u:\ns,t,u\\in\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\cup\n\\{s\\le t\\to s+u\\le t+u:\ns,t,u\\in\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\cup\n\\{\\bar0\\le s\\to \\bar0\\le k\\cdot s:\nk\\in\\mathbb N,\\ s\\in\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\cup\n\\{\\bar0\\le s\\to \\bar0\\le k\\cdot s:\nk\\in\\mathbb N,\\ s\\in\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并加入非退化序公理</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Nondeg}}=\\{\\bar0\\le\\bar1,\\ \\neg(\\bar1\\le\\bar0)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Nondeg}}=\\{\\bar0\\le\\bar1,\\ \\neg(\\bar1\\le\\bar0)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-Presburger-同余公理\">5. Presburger 同余公理</h1>\n<p>同余公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\equiv,\\mathsf{shift}}=\n\\{\\,t\\equiv_m r\\leftrightarrow t+\\,m\\cdot u\\equiv_m r\\mid\nt,u\\in\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA},\\ m\\ge2,\\ 0\\le r&lt;m\\,\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\equiv,\\mathsf{shift}}=\n\\{\\,t\\equiv_m r\\leftrightarrow t+\\,m\\cdot u\\equiv_m r\\mid\nt,u\\in\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA},\\ m\\ge2,\\ 0\\le r&lt;m\\,\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并定义每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\ge2\">\\(m\\ge2\\)</span> 的余数穷尽和互斥公式集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\equiv,\\mathsf{exh}}=\n\\{\\,\\operatorname{FinOr}_{QFPA}(F_{t,m},m):\nt\\in\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA},\\ m\\ge2,\\ F_{t,m}(r)=(t\\equiv_m r)\\,\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\equiv,\\mathsf{exh}}=\n\\{\\,\\operatorname{FinOr}_{QFPA}(F_{t,m},m):\nt\\in\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA},\\ m\\ge2,\\ F_{t,m}(r)=(t\\equiv_m r)\\,\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\equiv,\\mathsf{disj}}=\n\\{\\,(t\\equiv_m r\\land t\\equiv_m q)\\to\\bot:\nt\\in\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA},\\ m\\ge2,\\ 0\\le r&lt;q&lt;m\\,\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\equiv,\\mathsf{disj}}=\n\\{\\,(t\\equiv_m r\\land t\\equiv_m q)\\to\\bot:\nt\\in\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA},\\ m\\ge2,\\ 0\\le r&lt;q&lt;m\\,\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总同余公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\equiv}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\equiv,\\mathsf{shift}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\equiv,\\mathsf{exh}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\equiv,\\mathsf{disj}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\equiv}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\equiv,\\mathsf{shift}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\equiv,\\mathsf{exh}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\equiv,\\mathsf{disj}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{QFPA}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Bool}}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Group}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Const}}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\le}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Nondeg}}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\equiv}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{QFPA}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Bool}}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Group}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Const}}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\le}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Nondeg}}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\equiv}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-规则关系\">6. 规则关系</h1>\n<p>推理规则关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MP}}=\\{\\,((A,A\\to B),B)\\mid A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{QFPA}\\,\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MP}}=\\{\\,((A,A\\to B),B)\\mid A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{QFPA}\\,\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{QFPA}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_{QFPA}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{QFPA}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{QFPA}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{n-1})\">\\(\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{n-1})\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&gt;0\">\\(n&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{n-1}=A\">\\(A_{n-1}=A\\)</span>，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;n\">\\(j&lt;n\\)</span> 至少满足下列条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_j\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{QFPA}\">\\(A_j\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{QFPA}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r,s&lt;j\">\\(r,s&lt;j\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_r,A_s),A_j)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MP}}\">\\(((A_r,A_s),A_j)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MP}}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"8.-可导性\">8. 可导性</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{QFPA}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\,\\operatorname{Proof}_{QFPA}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{QFPA}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\,\\operatorname{Proof}_{QFPA}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标差异\">9. 目标差异</h1>\n<p>定义目标语言谓词</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QFPATerm}(t)\\Longleftrightarrow t\\in\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{QFPATerm}(t)\\Longleftrightarrow t\\in\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QFPAFrm}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{QFPA}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{QFPAFrm}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{QFPA}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由形成子句可检查：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{QFPAFrm}\">\\(\\mathsf{QFPAFrm}\\)</span> 不含量词构造，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{QFPATerm}\">\\(\\mathsf{QFPATerm}\\)</span> 不含项乘项构造，而同余原子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\equiv_m r\">\\(t\\equiv_m r\\)</span> 是原始公式；这三项给出目标差异。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-形式系统\">10. 形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{QFPA}=(\\mathsf{ZVar},\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA},\\mathsf{Frm}_{QFPA},\\operatorname{QFPATerm},\\operatorname{QFPAFrm},\\operatorname{FinOr}_{QFPA},\\mathrm{FV_T},\\mathrm{FV},\\operatorname{BV}_{QFPA},\\operatorname{Sub_T},\\operatorname{Sub_F},\\operatorname{FreeRen}_{QFPA},\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{QFPA},\\equiv_\\alpha^{QFPA},\\mathsf{Ax}_{QFPA},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MP}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{QFPA},\\vdash_{QFPA}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{QFPA}=(\\mathsf{ZVar},\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA},\\mathsf{Frm}_{QFPA},\\operatorname{QFPATerm},\\operatorname{QFPAFrm},\\operatorname{FinOr}_{QFPA},\\mathrm{FV_T},\\mathrm{FV},\\operatorname{BV}_{QFPA},\\operatorname{Sub_T},\\operatorname{Sub_F},\\operatorname{FreeRen}_{QFPA},\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{QFPA},\\equiv_\\alpha^{QFPA},\\mathsf{Ax}_{QFPA},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MP}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{QFPA},\\vdash_{QFPA}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只给出无乘法变量项、无量词的 Presburger 证明系统，不包含满足性算法或模型论结果。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"176.-量词自由-Presburger-算术-QFPA","text":"176. 量词自由 Presburger 算术 QFPA","level":1},{"id":"1.-变量、项与公式符号","text":"1. 变量、项与公式符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-量词自由语法","text":"2. 量词自由语法","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变量与代换","text":"3. 自由变量与代换","level":1},{"id":"4.-命题公理与线性整数公理","text":"4. 命题公理与线性整数公理","level":1},{"id":"5.-Presburger-同余公理","text":"5. Presburger 同余公理","level":1},{"id":"6.-规则关系","text":"6. 规则关系","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可导性","text":"8. 可导性","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标差异","text":"9. 目标差异","level":1},{"id":"10.-形式系统","text":"10. 形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{ZVar}=\\{z_0,z_1,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar n","display":false},{"tex":"k\\cdot t","display":false},{"tex":"t=u,\\qquad t\\le u,\\qquad t\\equiv_m r\\quad(m\\ge2,\\ 0\\le r<m).","display":true},{"tex":"\\bot,\\land,\\lor,\\to","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar n\\in\\mathsf{LTerm}_{QFPA}","display":fa